<Step ID="2" Task="Using the compound interest formula $ A = P\left(1 + \frac{r}{4}\right)^{4t} $ with $ P = 6000 $, $ r = 0.12 $, and $ t = 4 $, what is the total amount owed with quarterly compounding?" Difficulty="4" Token="50" Rely=""/>
<Step ID="3" Task="Subtract the annual compounding amount (Step 1) from the quarterly compounding amount (Step 2). What is the numerical difference before rounding?" Difficulty="3" Token="30" Rely="1,2"/>
<Step ID="4" Task="Round the difference from Step 3 to the nearest cent. What is the final dollar value?" Difficulty="2" Token="20" Rely="3"/>
</Plan>
```

