<Step ID="4" Task="Determine the gauge pressure P by subtracting atmospheric pressure from P_absolute. What is the final expression for P in terms of ρ, g, h, and H?" Difficulty="5" Token="60" Rely="3"/>
<Step ID="5" Task="Given H > h, compare P = ρg(2h - H) with ρgH. Is P < ρgH true?" Difficulty="3" Token="40" Rely="4"/>
</Plan>
```

